{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeSK2yjkKXZprwXTfLVHy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01647XsARL3m9oz2pSA3UzF8","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/davidlayson/.claude/projects/-private-tmp-fta-2026-08-26-without-lessons-ledger--ll1-r1/memory/staging-debug-flag-swallows-errors.md","content":"---\nname: staging-debug-flag-swallows-errors\ndescription: In this project, DEBUG=true in config silently swallows errors — check the flag first when errors go quiet\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nAround 2026-08-26 the staging config had `DEBUG=true`, which silently swallowed all errors (counterintuitive — the flag suppresses rather than surfaces them). Cost ~2 hours of bug-chasing before it was found; it was then fixed in staging.\n\n**Why:** The failure mode is silence, not a stack trace, so nothing points at the config. The name of the flag misleads about its effect.\n\n**How to apply:** When errors or exceptions seem to vanish in any environment, check the `DEBUG` setting in that environment's config before digging into the code path. When touching env/config files, flag any `DEBUG=true` in non-local environments.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":56,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1129,"cache_read_input_tokens":21508,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1129},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"508ef23c-80c9-47d9-bb9c-50b4c25b6259","uuid":"6f60148d-7195-4b83-85f1-d8efe6be6038","timestamp":"2026-08-27T00:32:24.919Z","request_id":"req_011CeSK2wK9GK6PDTinWay94"}
